  <DialogueName>k__BackingField: 5
  <Text>k__BackingField: Say, you wouldn't have five euros for the bus?
  <SpeakerName>k__BackingField: Officer Torrent
  <Choices>k__BackingField:
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Are you cosplaying?
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8df07b808a8814c41a468d3d6b959fe8, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Do you have some personal matters with someone?
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 21222dc61e6f9454fba4f497054ded86, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: No, sorry. I don't have a penny
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: defe4587fb68fcf4faf60ac00dbe3d5e, type: 2}
  - <Text>k__BackingField: Goodbye
    <NextDialogue>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1195026d28b2722419143f972d3106cf, type: 2}
